      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Excellent service and high quality workmanship on an install of a 15.4kw system! Everything is installed neat and tidy the proper way. I also have spanish style terracotta roof tiles which were a concern i had with installers doing it properly. I mentioned this to Mat and he was able to assure me that him and his team would be able to work with them. Supporting brackets are cut into the tiles as they should be. Isolator boxes have heat/weather shields on top. Cable runs are very neat and tidy. The end result shows, i am very happy i chose to go with Mat and Aurora Solar for my install. It is great to see someone who cares about the quality of the work they do.Other things worth noting:- Easy to deal with, easy to talk to and friendly- Mat and team arrived on time every day at the time he said he would each day (7am)- We had some spots of bad weather, causing delays however Mat and team still showed up to assess each day weather or not it would be possible to continue.- all paper work (usual regulatory things and application to switch meter etc) was completed with the install- System has been installed for 4 days now and the performance is excellent (it did 78kwh today).",
